  "description": "Nearly a Diamond Super Lite\n\nin specification, the Lite 3 also uses Easton taperwall butted aluminum main\n\nframe tubes and butted 7005-series alloy stays. The fork's a Judy SL with\n\n63mm of travel, the shock the same Pro Shock O2RL as the Super Lite, with\n\na lockout and rebound and compression control.\n\nThe parts are Deore-LX and XT, the pedals Shimano M515 clipless, the brakes\n\ndisc front and rear, Quando sealed alloy hubs with Formula B-4 ultralight\n\nhydraulic discs and Formula B-4 brake levers. Kore supplies the bar, stem\n\nand seat post. Cool bike. Fuji's Active Suspension works when you're in or out of\n\nthe saddle or when you're braking.\n\nCheck out Diamond Lite 3 at your Fuji dealer.",
